RESET TARGET, precisely re-confirmed (not assumed unchanged): exactly 6,265 rows have direct_parent_exception=NO_LINK_DECLARED with updated_at < 2026-08-24 -- the original, frozen-since-diagnosis set. Separately, 86 NEW exceptions were correctly written today by the FIXED code (real GLEIF answers) -- these are correct and must NOT be included in the reset (verified via updated_at filtering, not assumed).

