wn 5,000-headroom checkWriteBudget guard does NOT gate the manual reset UPDATE itself (that check only runs inside the Worker''s own dispatcher, not an ad-hoc SQL statement run directly) -- the reset must be manually scheduled on a day/time with real confirmed headroom, same discipline as every prior live test this packet has used.

